<title>RUSSIA: Russia delayed govt securities trading by 30 mins.</title>
<headline>Russia delayed govt securities trading by 30 mins.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in GKO discount Treasury bills and OFZ interest-bearing bonds on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange was delayed by 30 minutes on Monday because of computer problems, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>Trading is running from 11.30 a.m. (0830 GMT) to 1.30 p.m. (1030), instead of the ususal 11.00 a.m. to 1.00 p.m.</p>
<p>--Anna Smirnova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
